DTEND:20260927T195838Z
SUMMARY:(505) Cava hides a mag 12.0 star
DESCRIPTION:(505) Cava hides a magnitude 12.0 star\, seen from Varanasi.\nY
 ou are inside the path\, 59 km from its centre line: the star vanishes for
  up to 9.9 s.\nClosest approach 01:23:38 IST\, give or take 2 s. The star 
 is 61° up in the SSE · dark sky.\nIt fades 0.7 magnitudes for up to 25.4
  s on the centre line\, and the path is 115 km wide\, give or take 9 km.\n
 Finder chart\, the map and the path as KML: https://occult.alokm.com/aster
 oids-2026-09#2026-09-27-505-cava-112256
